{"code":"ko-KR","name":"Korean","native":"한국어","badge":"한","tts":"ko-KR","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"이해가 안 돼요.","say":"ihae-ga an dwaeyo","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"잘 모르겠어요.","say":"jal moreugesseoyo","en":"I don’t know. / I’m not sure.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"잠시만요.","say":"jamsimanyo","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"다시 한번 말해 주세요.","say":"dasi hanbeon malhae juseyo","en":"Please say that again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"천천히 말해 주세요.","say":"cheoncheonhi malhae juseyo","en":"Please speak slowly.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"“…”를 한국어로 뭐라고 해요?","say":"“…”reul hangugeo-ro mworago haeyo?","en":"How do you say “…” in Korean?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"물론이죠.","say":"mullonijyo","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"맞아요.","say":"majayo","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"그런 것 같아요.","say":"geureon geot gatayo","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"진짜요?","say":"jinjjayo?","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"괜찮아요.","say":"gwaenchanayo","en":"It’s okay. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"좋아요!","say":"joayo!","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x} 어디예요?","say":"{x} eodiyeyo?","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"{x} 주세요.","say":"{x} juseyo","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"{x} 있어요?","say":"{x} isseoyo?","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x} 부탁해요.","say":"{x} butakaeyo","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"이제 가야 돼요.","say":"ije gaya dwaeyo","en":"I have to go now.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"들어가도 돼요?","say":"deureogado dwaeyo?","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"확인해 볼게요.","say":"hwaginhae bolgeyo","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"회의가 있어요.","say":"hoeui-ga isseoyo","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"매워요?","say":"maewoyo?","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"양파 빼 주세요.","say":"yangpa ppae juseyo","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"뭐가 맛있어요?","say":"mwoga masisseoyo?","en":"What’s good here?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"고기는 안 먹어요.","say":"gogi-neun an meogeoyo","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"얼마예요?","say":"eolmayeyo?","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"그냥 구경하는 거예요.","say":"geunyang gugyeonghaneun geoyeyo","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"이걸로 할게요.","say":"igeollo halgeyo","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"카드 돼요?","say":"kadeu dwaeyo?","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"멀어요?","say":"meoreoyo?","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"공항으로 가 주세요.","say":"gonghang-euro ga juseyo","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"왼쪽 · 오른쪽 · 직진","say":"oenjjok · oreunjjok · jikjin","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"도와주세요!","say":"dowajuseyo!","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"휴지가 없어요.","say":"hyuji-ga eopseoyo","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"몸이 안 좋아요.","say":"mom-i an joayo","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"구급차 불러 주세요.","say":"gugeupcha bulleo juseyo","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"만나서 반가워요.","say":"mannaseo bangawoyo","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"어디에서 왔어요?","say":"eodieseo wasseoyo?","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"무슨 일 하세요?","say":"museun il haseyo?","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"정말 맛있어요!","say":"jeongmal masisseoyo!","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"안녕하세요.","say":"annyeonghaseyo","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"좋은 아침이에요.","say":"joeun achimieyo","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"잘 지내요?","say":"jal jinaeyo?","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"네. · 아니요.","say":"ne · aniyo","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"부탁해요.","say":"butakaeyo","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"감사합니다.","say":"gamsahamnida","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"죄송합니다.","say":"joesonghamnida","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"안녕히 가세요.","say":"annyeonghi gaseyo","en":"Goodbye. (to someone leaving)","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"일 · 이 · 삼","say":"il · i · sam","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"사 · 오 · 육","say":"sa · o · yuk","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"칠 · 팔 · 구","say":"chil · pal · gu","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"십 · 이십 · 백","say":"sip · isip · baek","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"사과가 빨개요.","say":"sagwa-ga ppalgaeyo","en":"The apple is red.","note":"adjectives work like verbs · 가 marks the subject"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"사과를 먹어요.","say":"sagwa-reul meogeoyo","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the verb goes last · 를 marks the object · “I” is dropped"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"사과를 먹었어요.","say":"sagwa-reul meogeosseoyo","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"-었어요 = past"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"사과를 먹고 싶어요.","say":"sagwa-reul meokgo sipeoyo","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"-고 싶어요 = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"사과 먹어요?","say":"sagwa meogeoyo?","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"same sentence; the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"화장실","say":"hwajangsil","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"약국","say":"yakguk","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"병원","say":"byeongwon","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"역","say":"yeok","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"공항","say":"gonghang","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"호텔","say":"hotel","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"물","say":"mul","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"커피","say":"keopi","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"계산서","say":"gyesanseo","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"메뉴","say":"menyu","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"맥주","say":"maekju","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"이거","say":"igeo","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"봉투","say":"bongtu","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"회의","say":"hoeui","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"파일","say":"pail","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"화면","say":"hwamyeon","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"메시지","say":"mesiji","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"내일","say":"naeil","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"}],"diet":{"title":"알레르기 · 읽어 주세요","ask":"이 음식에 이런 재료가 들어 있나요?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"감사합니다!","note":"Many broths use beef or anchovy stock. Ask even for vegetable dishes.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"땅콩 알레르기가 심해요. 땅콩과 땅콩기름을 먹을 수 없어요.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"갑각류와 조개류 알레르기가 있어요 (새우, 게, 조개).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"밀가루(글루텐)를 먹을 수 없어요.","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"고기, 닭고기, 생선을 안 먹어요.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"돼지고기를 안 먹어요.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"화장실","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"남자 · 여자","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"출구 · 입구","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"미세요 · 당기세요","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"비상구","en":"Emergency exit"}]}